    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know both can make u sleepy but is it really that bad? i only take the hydro once a day and i've never had any issues. i was just thinking of taking a small dose of the benadryl, like half a pill or something, just to take the edge off so i can sleep. surely a tiny bit wont kill me??",
